			"Message": "feat(Output): Add URI import to ExposeWorkbenchAccessor transform\n\nComplete the workbench accessor patch by statically importing the `URI` class alongside the existing service decorators. The previous commit exposed the URI via the `__CEL_SERVICES__` object, but the import statement was missing from the transform's header injection.\n\nThis fix ensures the transform plugin injects the necessary import for `URI` when patching `web.main.js` and `desktop.main.js`, allowing SkyBridge's search provider to construct resource objects the workbench accepts directly without a `URI.revive` round-trip.",
			"SHA": "3db8e24cd143fa7887d7395c6a0a2fbf53ac02f4"
		},
